<title>USA: Cole increases authorized shares.</title>
<headline>Cole increases authorized shares.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cole National Corp's shareholders approved an increase in the authorized outstanding shares of class A common stock to 40 million shares and preferred stock to five million shares.</p>
<p>Cole National's shareholders approved the measure at their annual shareholder meeting, the vision care retailer said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cole was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
</text>
